{"unit_id":"KekuKase__dsh-deepseek-status#card-zh","repo":"KekuKase/dsh-deepseek-status","commit":"5042e59f65084be1a940e5ebc88615a7b1926e0c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-status 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的服务状态插件，在会话头部显示 DeepSeek 官方服务状态。宿主定期抓取状态页并解析为快照，浏览器通过同源接口读取数据。面板展示整体与组件状态、进行中的事件、最近已解决事件、可用率和更新时间，并在抓取失败时保留上次成功结果。设置卡片允许调整状态页地址、轮询间隔和超时，保存后可即时应用。适合希望在 DSH 会话中查看 DeepSeek 服务健康情况的用户；默认无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:180-240","lib/index.js:88-158"]}
{"unit_id":"KekuKase__dsh-deepseek-status#card-en","repo":"KekuKase/dsh-deepseek-status","commit":"5042e59f65084be1a940e5ebc88615a7b1926e0c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-deepseek-status shows DeepSeek health in the DSH web session header. Its panel displays overall and component status, incidents, uptime, and update time. The host polls the status page and keeps the last good snapshot on errors. Settings are adjustable live; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:180-240","lib/index.js:88-158"]}
