{"unit_id":"KekuKase__dsh-deepseek-status#feature-1","repo":"KekuKase/dsh-deepseek-status","commit":"5042e59f65084be1a940e5ebc88615a7b1926e0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-status 的功能「状态概览」：在会话头部显示状态点和文字，点击可展开总体与各组件状态、事件和可用率。数据由浏览器定时从宿主同源路由读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:180-240","lib/client.js:462-470"]}
{"unit_id":"KekuKase__dsh-deepseek-status#feature-2","repo":"KekuKase/dsh-deepseek-status","commit":"5042e59f65084be1a940e5ebc88615a7b1926e0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-status 的功能「状态采集」：宿主按配置访问状态页并解析其页面数据，生成包含整体状态、组件、事件和可用率的快照，供网页面板读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:88-105","lib/parser.js:156-168"]}
{"unit_id":"KekuKase__dsh-deepseek-status#feature-3","repo":"KekuKase/dsh-deepseek-status","commit":"5042e59f65084be1a940e5ebc88615a7b1926e0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-status 的功能「可调配置」：用户可修改状态页地址、抓取频率和单次超时；配置变化后宿主重新设置轮询定时器，无需重启即可应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:35-39","lib/index.js:112-128"]}
{"unit_id":"KekuKase__dsh-deepseek-status#feature-4","repo":"KekuKase/dsh-deepseek-status","commit":"5042e59f65084be1a940e5ebc88615a7b1926e0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-status 的功能「故障保留」：上游请求或解析失败时记录错误，并继续提供上次成功的状态快照；首次成功数据尚未取得时返回未知状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:81-104","lib/index.js:136-158"]}
{"unit_id":"KekuKase__dsh-deepseek-status#caveat-1","repo":"KekuKase/dsh-deepseek-status","commit":"5042e59f65084be1a940e5ebc88615a7b1926e0c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-status 使用宿主定时请求配置的状态页地址，默认目标为 status.deepseek.com；更改地址会把请求发往所填服务，且抓取失败会保留旧快照。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:88-104","lib/index.js:35-39"]}
